[[Dante Vale]] used Spidertouch to cling onto [[Ymir]] during the mission [[The Hammer of Thor]], making the giant [[Titans|Titan]] fall into a nearby canyon. {{Source|The Legacy of Thor|}} Inside a ship belonging to [[Atalanta|Atlanta]] sunk in the [[Stavropolous River]], Dante Vale used this spell once again to grab the [[Sword of Saint George]] from [[DeFoe]]'s hands, with which he was holding Sophie Casterwill hostage. {{Source|The Treasures of the Argonauts}}

